# Files Cloudflare must NOT upload as public assets.
#
# wrangler.jsonc points the assets directory at the repo root, which otherwise
# publishes everything in the checkout - including .git. An exposed .git is the
# single most commonly probed misconfiguration on the web, and it would leak the
# whole history immediately if this repo were ever made private.
#
# Config files are still read at build time; this only stops them being served.

.git
.gitignore
.assetsignore
.claude
tools
README.md
wrangler.jsonc
